{
  "schema": "hoi4-passive-capture-ready-receipt-dialects-fixture-v1",
  "note": "Real CaptureReadyV2 receipts plus derived variants, retained so the harness-side rebuild of the authenticated payload can be replayed against digests it did not produce. Every expected digest here was computed outside PowerShell from the receipt fields and the pipe token, so none of them is the rebuild restating itself. pipe_token is the per-attach nonce run t36 used as the HMAC key; the process and the pipe it named are long gone, and it is kept only so these digests stay reproducible. Every case carries install_freeze_count, which is what CaptureReadyV2 offset 50 became. The t36/t35 receipts predate the field and authenticated the reserved zero it replaced, so theirs is written out as an explicit 0 rather than left absent: an absent property is refused by the rebuild, because reading it as a zero is precisely the assumption that refused six captures.",
  "pipe_token": "f743c8f124d2572ad18b99db033554ba",
